  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jVmUTGFMX5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1051116089133777016?color=green&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=green&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全亮資源包</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3>✨ 功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>亮度提升</strong>：提升整體亮度，確保在任何地方都能清晰視物。</li>\n<li><strong>水下視野</strong>：即使在最深的海洋中也能清晰視物。</li>\n<li><strong>明亮洞穴</strong>：探索洞穴與礦坑，無需使用火把。</li>\n<li><strong>璀璨夜晚</strong>：在夜晚中行動，宛如白晝般清晰。</li>\n<li><strong>相容其他資源包</strong>：能與其他資源包無縫搭配使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>⚙️ 需求</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>OptiFine</strong>：此資源包需要安裝 OptiFine 才能正常運作。<br>請在新增材質包之前先完成安裝。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🖼️ 預覽</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cc2HeoV.png\" alt=\"全亮資源包展示\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblocklegend001%253fr%253dCurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/8fd2f0f5-1266-429b-b91c-d015a2026f31.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 橫幅\"></a></p>",
